{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Welcome to Groovity!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Groovity</strong> is a vibrant 2.5D platformer where you can change gravity at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate gravity as you explore a spaceship full of traps, puzzles, and dangers. Walk on the ceiling, fall down walls, and dodge projectiles while moving at full speed. <strong>Groovity</strong> challenges you to think on the move and break the traditional logic of platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/b6e8340c5156fd715291c0372baa2e40.poster.avif?t=1751485373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/b6e8340c5156fd715291c0372baa2e40.mp4?t=1751485373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Help Groovy escape</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist, <strong>Groovy</strong>, is a fearless alien trapped in the NeoCosmos ship, a ruthless corporation. Your mission: retrieve a next-gen gravity prototype, free your companions, and escape in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/f81d5c87df33ba54ed760143b8dcb73d.poster.avif?t=1751485373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/f81d5c87df33ba54ed760143b8dcb73d.mp4?t=1751485373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Our world uncovered</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our adventure takes place aboard a <strong>NeoCosmos</strong> ship filled with bright lights, disco music, and rooms brimming with energy. Create your own path, solve challenges with creativity, and get lost in a world where every level is a different challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/3618571949bf6a211e974e937806d1d3.poster.avif?t=1751485373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/3618571949bf6a211e974e937806d1d3.mp4?t=1751485373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>The evolution of platformers in your hands</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Groovity</strong> offers a fresh and challenging experience, where by altering the environment you can do much more than just jump from platform to platform, gravity can be your greatest ally\u2026 and also your greatest challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/2da2b6a95e0edb7f008091e6ed69f807.poster.avif?t=1751485373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/2da2b6a95e0edb7f008091e6ed69f807.mp4?t=1751485373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587530?t=1751485373","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587530?t=1751485373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/bcc8613503ff5488f92a8f530fde6c93ce8b6bed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751485373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/bcc8613503ff5488f92a8f530fde6c93ce8b6bed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751485373","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Welcome to Groovity!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Groovity</strong> is a vibrant 2.5D platformer where you can change gravity at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate gravity as you explore a spaceship full of traps, puzzles, and dangers. Walk on the ceiling, fall down walls, and dodge projectiles while moving at full speed. <strong>Groovity</strong> challenges you to think on the move and break the traditional logic of platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/b6e8340c5156fd715291c0372baa2e40.poster.avif?t=1751485373\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587530/extras/b6e8340c5156fd715291c0372baa2e40.mp4?t=1751485373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Help Groovy escape</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our protagonist, <strong>Groovy</strong>, is a fearless alien trapped in the NeoCosmos ship, a ruthless corporation. Your mission: retrieve a next-gen gravity prototype, free your companions, and escape in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.ak